Subject: Recover missing direct-branch targets inside a function

Branch targets the disassembler did not decode are decoded within 64 KiB of the function and
lifted as local labels (patches/lifter/fci_direct.py), so flags and loops stay in one C function.
Recovered streams follow their original fallthrough; anything ambiguous is left unresolved.

---
